        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I have to agree, the symmetry with `o`/`O` is really neat, I built muscle memory using `o` and `O` then `esc` to create blank lines so I personally prefer `go` and `gO` too.\n\nWe can close the issue if no action needs to be taken to align with the goals of mini.nvim, or I'd be happy to help with documentation if you give some guidance, if necessary.",
